<title>USA: Minot, N.D., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Minot, N.D., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said it won $2.580 million of Minot, N.D., refunding improvement bonds, 1996 B, with a net interest cost of 4.715 percent.</p>
</text>
